Package: masurium-launcher
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, libxcb-cursor0
Recommends: openjdk-21-jre-headless
Section: games
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/CharquiPayload/masurium
Description: launcher for Masurium's AI-driven Minecraft bots
 Creates, starts and watches Masurium bots: Minecraft players driven by an AI
 brain (Claude Code), each one a real client joining your server. Brings the
 Masurium mod jars, and the window's Qt for Python as wheels, installed into an
 environment of its own without internet. Its data stays in the home of each
 user who runs it (~/.local/share/masurium and ~/.masurium).
